{
  "_": [
    "The scheme. Edit it here or press `e` in the app; both write this file, and",
    "the app picks up a save while the show runs. A parse error keeps whatever was",
    "last working and reports itself in the panel.",
    "",
    "Saving from the editor writes the WHOLE resolved scheme, so this file grows to",
    "state everything rather than inheriting the built-in defaults in",
    "server/scheme.ts. That is deliberate: a file that says exactly what the show is",
    "has no invisible inheritance to reason about at two in the morning. Delete the",
    "file entirely and the built-in scheme is a complete show on its own.",
    "",
    "The cascade is song -> archetype -> track -> clip. Scalars override, effects",
    "add up, energyBias accumulates. Live signals are not a level: the meter and the",
    "beat thread through every source and effect as uniforms. See docs/mapping.md.",
    "",
    "sources: solid bars rings noise strobe grid",
    "effects: mirror kaleido shift pixelate ripple smear",
    "blends:  over add screen multiply"
  ],
  "colorways": {
    "aurora": [
      "#3cc8ff",
      "#6ee7a0",
      "#9b5aff",
      "#3cff9b",
      "#e8f4ff"
    ],
    "ember": [
      "#ff5a3c",
      "#ffd23c",
      "#ff2d6f",
      "#ff9b3c",
      "#fff0c8"
    ],
    "dusk": [
      "#9b5aff",
      "#ff2d6f",
      "#3c6eff",
      "#ffd23c",
      "#f0e8ff"
    ],
    "mono": [
      "#ffffff",
      "#b7b7be",
      "#5e5e66",
      "#ececed",
      "#8b8b93"
    ]
  },
  "songs": {
    "baby again": "dusk",
    "sandstorm": "ember",
    "strobe": "mono"
  },
  "archetypes": {
    "INTRO": {
      "energy": 0.2,
      "effects": [
        "smear"
      ]
    },
    "VERSE": {
      "energy": 0.35,
      "effects": []
    },
    "BUILD": {
      "energy": 0.65,
      "effects": [
        "ripple"
      ]
    },
    "CHORUS": {
      "energy": 0.92,
      "effects": [
        "kaleido",
        "ripple"
      ]
    },
    "BRIDGE": {
      "energy": 0.45,
      "effects": [
        "mirror"
      ]
    },
    "JAM1": {
      "energy": 0.75,
      "effects": [
        "shift",
        "ripple"
      ]
    },
    "JAM2": {
      "energy": 0.8,
      "effects": [
        "mirror",
        "kaleido"
      ]
    },
    "ENDING": {
      "energy": 0.3,
      "effects": [
        "smear"
      ]
    },
    "PRACTICE": {
      "energy": 0.15,
      "effects": []
    }
  },
  "tracks": [
    {
      "match": "\\b(kick|drums?|beats?|perc|snare)\\b",
      "source": "strobe",
      "energyBias": 0.1,
      "floor": 0
    },
    {
      "match": "\\b(bass|sub|808|303)\\b",
      "source": "bars",
      "floor": 0.05
    },
    {
      "match": "\\barps?\\b",
      "source": "bars",
      "energyBias": 0.05
    },
    {
      "match": "\\b(lead|solo|gtr|guitar|vox|vocal)\\b",
      "source": "rings",
      "energyBias": 0.1
    },
    {
      "match": "\\b(pad|strings?|atmos|amb|texture)\\b",
      "source": "noise",
      "energyBias": -0.15
    },
    {
      "match": "\\b(keys?|synth|chords?|piano|organ|pluck)\\b",
      "source": "grid"
    }
  ],
  "clips": [],
  "defaults": {
    "colorway": "aurora",
    "energy": 0.4,
    "blend": [
      "over",
      "add",
      "screen",
      "add",
      "multiply",
      "add"
    ],
    "sources": [
      "bars",
      "rings",
      "grid",
      "noise",
      "strobe",
      "solid"
    ],
    "maxEffects": 2
  }
}
